# Now that the spin is killed and the estimate is perfect (est == true), tune the tilt gains
# for real: drive the TRUE attitude to vertical and hold it against the gravity turn. The
# gentle baked gains (6.0 / 0.24) under-command -- the fins sit at 0.01-0.05 at an 18 deg lean
# and the tilt walks up to 100 deg. Roughly double them. Watch the true tilt drive DOWN toward
# 0 and the steady TRUE tilt go under 8 (mission PASS). If it starts oscillating, back off.
ATC_ANG_RLL_P 12.0
ATC_ANG_PIT_P 12.0
ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.5
ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.5
ATC_RAT_RLL_D 0.02
ATC_RAT_PIT_D 0.02
ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.0
ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.0
